# Smart Robot ROS 2 System

This repository is a ROS 2 project demonstrating modular robot communication using topics, services, parameters, and launch files.

## Contents

- ROS 2 Python package
- Robot sensor simulation
- Controller node with decision logic
- Battery monitoring node
- Dashboard/monitor node
- Launch file for startup

